<body data-new-gr-c-s-loaded="14.1045.0" style="height: auto; min-height: auto;"><br />
Your intent to claim for <b>{!Case.Freight_AWB_Number__c}</b> has been submitted
<br/>
Reference number: <b>{!Case.CaseNumber}</b>
<br/>
<br/>
Thank you for completing the first step of our claims process.  
<br/>
<br/>
To proceed to the next step – lodge a formal claim – we will need further details from   
you. Without these details your claim will not progress and cannot be assessed. Please   
ensure you carefully follow all steps advised.
<br/>
<h3>Your Next step: <b>lodge a formal claim</b></h3>
To lodge a formal claim, you’ll need to provide additional information. For more details on the required information, please refer to <a href="https://freight.qantas.com/au-en/help/claims.html">Claims Help</a> on our website.
</br>
</br>
Formal claims must be lodged within the <a href="https://freight.qantas.com/au-en/help/claims.html">specified timeframe</a>. Further information is available on our <a href="https://freight.qantas.com/au-en/help/claims.html">website</a> and in our <a href="https://freight.qantas.com/au-en/conditions-of-carriage-domestic.html">Conditions of Carriage (within of Australia)</a> or <a href="https://freight.qantas.com/au-en/conditions-of-carriage-international.html">Conditions of Carriage (outside of Australia)</a>.
<br/>
<br/>
<h3>Where to send this information?</h3>
<b>Claims for domestic shipments (eligible for shippers or receivers)</b>
</br>
</br>
Reply to this email with the additional information required to lodge a formal claim.
</br>
</br>
Please note only one party–shipper or receiver–may lodge the formal claim.
</br>
</br>
<b>Claims for international shipments (eligible for receivers only)</b>
<ul>
    <li>If the final destination is <b>within Australia or New Zealand</b>, reply to this email with the additional information required.</li>
    <li>If the final destination is <b>outside Australia or New Zealand</b>, the receiver must contact their local <a href="https://freight.qantas.com/au-en/freight-terminals.html#international">Qantas Freight office</a> or ground handling agent and follow their claims process as local regulations vary.</li>
</ul>
</br>
<b>Your shipment details </b>
</br>
</br>
