</br>
</br>
<b>A reminder that strict <a href="https://freight.qantas.com/au-en/help/claims.html">time limitations</a> apply for lodging your formal claim. </b>
</br>
</br>
<b>We’re here to help!</b>
</br>
</br>
If you need assistance with lodging a formal claim or have any further questions, get in touch with our Customer Service Team at <b>13 12 13</b> or reply to this email.
